WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:02,870
recruit

2
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:05,670
Isn't it possible that your kid spoiled the new recruits?

3
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:06,990
So come here and beg for mercy.

4
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:09,070
Didn't I tell you to be careful?

5
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:10,830
Boss, can you listen to me first?

6
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:17,000
Say something, say something. What's there to say?

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,080
I told you before to restrain yourself.

8
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:22,920
How will our military camp recruit people if this continues?

9
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,760
Only a devil is willing to run to this damn place

10
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:27,510
What did your kid say?

11
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:28,550
Okay, boss

12
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:32,470
Can you wait until I explain it clearly to you? Report it to the boss.

13
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,590
The barbarians from the North are here again

14
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:40,880
Do these barbarians never rest every day?

15
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:43,000
Is it fun to run around every day?

16
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:44,920
Boss, what should we do now?

17
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,310
What else can be done

18
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:48,950
Get someone to fuck me

19
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:52,640
Let them never come back this time

20
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,750
Why are you still standing here?

21
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:56,830
Hurry up and call the boss

22
00:00:57,190 --> 00:00:58,630
that recruit

23
00:00:58,630 --> 00:01:00,510
Everyone who comes here is my soldier.

24
00:01:00,790 --> 00:01:01,790
Take it with you

25
00:01:02,350 --> 00:01:05,460
The risk of being dissatisfied with the barbarian

26
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:07,460
Let’s talk about it when we come back alive
